# Authors

Copyright holder and primary author of XVPN / 幽门:

- **LUSIDA**
  - Website: <https://www.lusida.net>
  - GitHub organization: [LSD-Apps](https://github.com/LSD-Apps)
  - Maintainer account: [LSD2024](https://github.com/LSD2024)
  - Commit identity used in this repository:
    `LSD2024 <LSD2024@noreply.gitcode.com>`

Canonical repository: <https://github.com/LSD-Apps/XVPN>

「幽门」是面向用户的产品名（应用图标、窗口标题、托盘、系统 VPN 通知都用它）；
`XVPN` 是仓库与可执行文件的名字，两者指同一个软件。发布附件也因此仍叫
`XVPN-<版本>-<平台>`：改名附件会让已经装好的旧版本找不到升级包。

## Attribution policy

Authorship is attributed to the human maintainer / copyright holder above.
**AI coding assistants are tools, not authors or contributors.** Do not add
`Co-authored-by` trailers for assistants (for example `Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`),
and do not list them in `AUTHORS`, `CITATION.cff`, or release notes.

See also [`.mailmap`](.mailmap) and [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](CONTRIBUTING.md).
